Roles: `clinic_admin`, `clinic_branch_manager`, `clinic_doctor`, `clinic_receptionist`, `clinic_nurse`, `clinic_lab_tech`, `clinic_radiology_tech`, `clinic_pharmacist`, `clinic_cashier`, `clinic_accountant`, `clinic_inventory_mgr`, `clinic_purchase_officer`, `clinic_hr_admin`, `clinic_home_collection`, `clinic_telemed_coord`, `clinic_crm_staff`, `clinic_quality_mgr`, `clinic_patient_portal`, `clinic_owner_analytics`, `super_admin`.
**Finding:** `cmsDashboardSpec` me **saare 20 roles ka depth identical** hai (4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 2 alerts / 4 queues / 4 actions, **0 domain modules**): generic template. Neeche har role ke liye specific target hai.
**Family rule:** clinic = chhota setup: kam widgets, bade buttons, front-desk-first; single login me doctor+owner mix ko alag roles (`clinic_admin` vs `clinic_doctor`) me todo (file 12).

### Clinic Admin / Owner (single clinic) (`clinic_admin`)
- **Purpose:** Run the clinic: patients, queue, billing, staff, inventory, compliance.
- **Current status:** spec `cmsDashboardSpec` · route `ClinicAdminDashboard` · current depth: 4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 2 alerts / 4 queues / 5 actions / 0 modules
- **KPI cards (target):** Patients today (new/repeat); Waiting now + avg wait; Revenue today/MTD; Collected vs dues; No-show %; Slot utilisation %; NPS; Staff on duty
- **Worklists / queues:** Live OPD board per doctor; Pending bills/dues; Recalls & follow-ups due; Inventory alerts (low/expiry); Staff tasks
- **Alerts:** Licence/council reg expiry; Stock-out; Dues > 30d; Complaint
- **Quick actions:** Register patient, New bill, Open schedule, Approve discount
- **Sections / tabs:** Overview · Patients · Billing · Inventory · Staff · Compliance · Marketing
- **Features:** KPI cards driven by `/clinic/dashboard` (server-side); Doctor-wise performance & service-wise revenue; Price list/packages/memberships; Recall engine (WhatsApp/SMS); Compliance pack (BMW log, rate list, registration display); Staff as real users with RBAC (invite)
- **Data / APIs:** `/clinic/*` (dashboard, analytics, queue, price-list, packages, recalls, inventory, staff/invite)
- **Permissions & privacy:** Clinic-scoped; PHI via care roles only.

